+#
+# Two changes for this tree, both required to build a 3.4 kernel with a
+# modern host and a modern cross compiler:
+#
+#   1. python2 -> python3.  The original used print statements and iterated
+#      over a bytes stream; on a box where /usr/bin/python is 3.x that is a
